.Dd November 5, 2026
.Dt PDP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pdp
.Nd open the PDP-10 console and the AI Lab terminal simulators
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar command
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the operator front door for the PiDP-10: it attaches to the simh session,
and opens the PDP-10 console and the peripheral simulators the boot scripts
expect to find on
.Em PATH ,
each inside a terminal emulator so it gets a real TTY.
The engine itself is controlled by
.Xr pdpcontrol 1 ;
.Nm
starts no PDP-10.
.Pp
Peripheral programs are resolved first from
.Em PATH
(where the
.Nm pidp10
package and the device-sim packages install them), then from
.Ev PIDP10_BIN ,
then from a development checkout under
.Ev PIDP10_HOME .
A missing device sim names the package to install rather than failing
mysteriously.
.Pp
The commands:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic sim
The default with no command: attach, in this terminal, to the screen session
.Dq pidp10
that
.Pa pidp10-engine@.service
runs the PDP-10 in, as the
.Nm pidp10
user.
This is where simh's
.Ic sim>
prompt is: press ^E to stop the machine and get it,
.Ic c
to continue, and Ctrl-A d to detach and leave everything running.
Several people may be attached at once.
Attaching goes through
.Xr sudo 8
and needs membership of the
.Nm pidp10
group.
.It Ic view
Open the all-in-one
.Xr tilix 1
layout
.Pa /usr/share/pidp10/view.json :
the PDP-10's simh session, the console, and the Knight TV server's log.
Its panes run tilix profiles that must be in your tilix settings first; see
.Ic view-setup .
.It Ic view-setup
Add the PiDP-10 tilix profiles to your tilix settings, once per user.
Only the five PiDP-10 profiles are added; your own profiles and tilix
settings are kept.
.It Ic con
The Teletype Model 33: the bundled
.Xr sty 1
terminal attached to the console port.
.It Ic telcon | console
Plain telnet to the console port in an xterm.
.It Ic vt52 | vt05
DEC VT52 / VT05 emulator (from the
.Nm vt05
package) in its own window, on ITS terminal line 9 (port 10018).
.It Ic tvcon
Knight TV display (from the
.Nm tvcon
package), connected to the
.Nm tv11
display server
.Pq Pa pidp10-tv11@.service , started with the engine .
.It Ic tek | tek4010
Tektronix 4010 storage tube (from the
.Nm tek4010
package) at 9600 baud, on ITS terminal line 8 (port 10017).
.It Ic imlac
IMLAC PDS-1 (from the
.Nm imlac
package) running
.Pa conf/imlac.simh ,
on ITS terminal line 7 (port 10016).
.It Ic dp3300 | dp3300-ascii
Datapoint 3300, on ITS terminal line 15 (port 10020).
.It Ic type340
Reopen the KA10's Type 340 display window: types ^E,
.Ic set dpy dis ,
.Ic set dpy ena
and
.Ic c
into the simh session, as upstream's
.Pa type340.expect
did.
.It Ic sty
The Teletype emulator on the console port, as
.Ic con .
.It Ic gt40
A GT40 (PDP-11 with a VT11 display): Open SIMH's
.Nm open-simh-pdp11
(or
.Ev PIDP10_PDP11 )
running
.Pa conf/gt40.simh ,
in a terminal, on ITS terminal line 11 (port 10019).
.It Ic pdp6
Attach, in this terminal, to the PDP-6's screen session
.Dq pidp6 .
The session is the PDP-6 console, and ^E there gives its
.Ic sim>
prompt.
The PDP-6 is
.Pa pidp10-pdp6.service ,
not a boot number: it runs next to ITS on the KA10
.Pq Ic pdpcontrol start 1
and shares memory with it through the KA10's
.Ic auxcpu
device.
Start it with
.Ic systemctl start pidp10-pdp6.service .
.It Ic tv11-tty
Not offered; use
.Ic tvcon .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev PIDP10_CONSOLE_PORT
Console telnet port (default 1025; policy lives in
.Pa /etc/pidp10/pidp10.conf ) .
.It Ev PIDP10_TV11_PORT
Port on the
.Nm tv11
display server that
.Ic tvcon
connects to; unset uses tvcon's default, which is where tv11 serves.
.It Ev PIDP10_TERMINAL
Terminal emulator to launch commands in; without it, tilix, gnome-terminal,
xfce4-terminal and xterm are tried in that order.
.It Ev PIDP10_BIN , PIDP10_HOME
Locations searched for locally built device sims.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
is 1 when a peripheral program cannot be found, and 2 on a bad command line.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic pdp con
Type on the Teletype.
.It Ic pdp vt52
Attach a VT52 to the console.
.It Ic PIDP10_TERMINAL=alacritty pdp tvcon
Watch Mazewar in another emulator.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pdpcontrol 1 ,
.Xr sty 1 ,
.Xr systemctl 1 ,
.Pa /usr/share/doc/pidp10/README.md
(the packaging guide, whose
.Dq The device sims
table names the upstream package of every peripheral).
